sequenceDiagram
    participant GOL as GameOfLife
    participant Grid
    participant Cell
    participant CS as CellState
    participant RS as RuleSet
    participant NS as NewCellState

    Note over GOL,RS: One Generation Update Cycle
    
    GOL->>Grid: update()
    activate Grid
    
    Note over Grid,RS: Phase 1: Calculate Next States (for all cells)
    
    loop for each cell in grid
        Grid->>Cell: getX(), getY()
        activate Cell
        Cell-->>Grid: x, y coordinates
        deactivate Cell
        
        Grid->>Grid: countNeighbors(x, y)
        activate Grid
        
        Note over Grid: Count live neighbors<br/>around this cell<br/>(handles toric wrapping)
        
        loop for each of 8 neighbors
            Grid->>Grid: calculate neighbor position<br/>(with wraparound if toric)
            Grid->>Cell: isAlive()
            activate Cell
            Cell->>CS: isAlive()
            activate CS
            CS-->>Cell: true/false
            deactivate CS
            Cell-->>Grid: true/false
            deactivate Cell
            Grid->>Grid: increment count if alive
        end
        
        Grid-->>Grid: neighborCount
        deactivate Grid
        
        Note over Grid,RS: Ask RuleSet what this cell should become
        
        Grid->>Cell: isAlive()
        activate Cell
        Cell->>CS: isAlive()
        activate CS
        CS-->>Cell: currentlyAlive
        deactivate CS
        Cell-->>Grid: currentlyAlive
        deactivate Cell
        
        Grid->>RS: calculateNextState(currentlyAlive, neighborCount)
        activate RS
        
        Note over RS: Apply Conway's Rules:<br/>- Alive + 2-3 neighbors → stay alive<br/>- Dead + 3 neighbors → become alive<br/>- Otherwise → die
        
        RS->>NS: create new CellState<br/>(AliveState or DeadState)
        activate NS
        NS-->>RS: newState
        deactivate NS
        
        RS-->>Grid: newState
        deactivate RS
        
        Grid->>Cell: prepareNextState(newState)
        activate Cell
        Note over Cell: Store next state<br/>without applying yet
        Cell-->>Grid: done
        deactivate Cell
    end
    
    Note over Grid,Cell: Phase 2: Apply Next States (for all cells simultaneously)
    
    loop for each cell in grid
        Grid->>Cell: applyNextState()
        activate Cell
        
        Note over Cell: Replace current state<br/>with next state
        Cell->>Cell: currentState = nextState
        Cell->>Cell: nextState = nullptr
        
        Cell-->>Grid: done
        deactivate Cell
    end
    
    Grid-->>GOL: update complete
    deactivate Grid
    
    Note over GOL: Generation complete,<br/>grid is now in next state